{"ID":"20240515131431-hk6kxze","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131431-hk6kxze","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131431-hk6kxze\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134152-uemd145\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134152-uemd145\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:311,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134152-uemd145\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:477,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:477\u0026#125;","title":"035","type":"doc","updated":"20240515154843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515134152-uemd145","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 901px;","id":"20240515134152-uemd145","updated":"20240515154843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/06"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CX"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"43 中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/06"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：\n2000年迄今，走路則氣短，上樓也喘，走長路常感到腰痛，西醫診斷為LAM-lymphangioleiomyomatosis肺淋巴管平滑肌瘤病，左背上有一大氣泡(肺區)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n吸入困難，一走快就感覺到。師曰，腎能納氣，吸入難為腎的問題。吐氣難為肺的問題。\n睡不好，不易入眠，多夢，頭昏，夢都想到孩子讀書問題。\n腰痛背後第五椎和第十四椎左右。心口如有重物壓。\n胃口正常。\n無口渴。\n雙足冷冰，手冷。\n無汗出，怕冷。肌肉關節無痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：脈弦細無力→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"少陰脈"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡黃白濕\n2、眼診 : 左腎陽失，右腎還好，肝區損傷。師曰，腎不得肺津，久之連心也傷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 裡寒重之人"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\n生附三銭(另包)，乾薑三錢，炙甘草五錢，生地兩銭，補骨脂三錢，桂枝五錢，\n枳實三錢，澤瀉五錢，麻黃三錢，細辛兩銭，炮附子三錢。\n拾付，\n九碗煮三碗，\n早晚飯前服用。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n生附，乾薑，炙甘草為四逆湯。\n生地，補骨脂補腎。\n澤瀉助腎排尿，用補劑時加一點瀉，讓腎喘息。\n麻黃宣肺。憂傷肺，告知病人要快樂。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}